# Contributing to Lux Rift

Thank you for helping improve Lux Rift.

## Good contributions

- Browser compatibility fixes
- Touch and pointer interaction improvements
- Shader performance or visual-quality improvements
- Accessibility and reduced-motion improvements
- Documentation corrections

## Development

The project has no build step or runtime dependencies.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/slivenred/lux-rift.git
cd lux-rift
python3 -m http.server 8080
```

Open `http://localhost:8080` and test your change in both desktop and mobile viewports.

## Pull requests

1. Keep each pull request focused on one improvement.
2. Explain the visual or behavioral change clearly.
3. Include a screenshot or short recording for visual changes.
4. Verify that the browser console has no errors.
5. Preserve keyboard, touch, and reduced-motion behavior.

By contributing, you agree that your contribution will be licensed under the MIT License.
